<title>DENMARK: Kommunekredit issues 565 mln DKK 4 PCT 2007 bond.</title>
<headline>Kommunekredit issues 565 mln DKK 4 PCT 2007 bond.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following new bond issue was announced on Tuesday by arranger Den Danske Bank.</p>
<p>BORROWER: KOMMUNEKREDIT	    AMOUNT: 565 MILLION CROWNS</p>
<p>COUPON: FOUR PERCENT		 MATURITY: JANUARY 15, 2007.</p>
<p>ISSUE DATE: MAY 14, 1997	   ISSUE PRICE: AS MARKET AT ISSUE</p>
<p>--Steve Weizman, Copenhagen newsroom +45 33 969650</p>
</text>
